# Lurrus of the Dream-Den: "Companion - Each permanent card in your starting deck has mana value 2 or less." A companion is
# revealed before the game only if the starting deck fulfils its condition (CR 103.2b). Bot1 chose Lurrus, but its deck holds
# a Lurrus of its own, a permanent card with mana value 3 (the companion ability does nothing in the deck, but the card is
# still a permanent card of it), so Bot1's is not revealed: it is a sideboard card, and Bot1 has no companion to take, though
# it has the mana. Bot2's deck of Islands fulfils it. In a real start the starting player is chosen first (CR 103.1) and the
# companions are revealed after (CR 103.2b), with nothing asked of anyone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp x7
Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Swamp x20

[Bot1 Companion]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Bot2 Companion]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den

[Opening]
Chooser: Bot1

[Actions]
Bot1.DrawFirst
! Bot1.Choose
? Bot1.Companion =
? Bot2.Companion = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
! Bot1.Sideboard.Lurrus of the Dream-Den.TakeCompanion

[Expect]
Bot1.Companion =
Bot1.Sideboard = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot2.Companion = Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Bot2.Sideboard =
